    "role": "stealth",
    "tier": 3,
    "factionId": "",
    "notes": "<p>A living, hateful secret: a truth so terrible it was violently repressed, and grew a mind of its own in the dark. Mostly transparent — a heat-haze glitch with spectral faces drifting through it — it haunts ruins and battlefields, drawn to betrayal. It does not fight. It makes your friends do that, wearing the face of whoever you trust most, and eats the despair that follows.</p><p><strong>Qliphah:</strong> Satariel, the Veils — the Hull of Binah. The greater art of concealment: a lie with your loved one's voice.</p><p><em>Mal's note: 'If an ally you buried walks up mid-fight with urgent news — receipts first, hugs later.'</em></p>",
